// 九尾狐 on all fours, for the skinned-mesh spike: a white fox spirit,
// drawn the way chibi kitsune are. A round, short-legged body; a round,
// cat-like face with a short muzzle, big eyes with a pink iris, red
// eyeliner and two red stripes on each cheek; ears red from the tip down,
// flaring cheek tufts, a fluffy ruff, a red cord with a bell; and nine
// plump teardrop tails opening behind like the petals of a flower, white
// through pink to red, swaying like seaweed.
// The tails come from gen_tails.py: change them there and paste the
// output back in.
